# Debug Stub CSV Example
# Copy this file to "debug_stub.csv" to enable wizard pre-fill during development
# The actual debug_stub.csv is in .gitignore and will not be committed

# Format (single line, comma-separated):
# device_tracker,person,notifier,tolerance,activation_mode,tag_model,webhook_token,debug_mode

# Example:
device_tracker.vehicle_tag,person.john_doe,notify.mobile_app_phone,500,manual,samsung_smarttag2,example_token_123,true

# Field descriptions:
# 1. device_tracker: Your device tracker entity ID (e.g., device_tracker.smarttag)
# 2. person: Person entity ID (e.g., person.john)
# 3. notifier: Notify service (e.g., notify.mobile_app or notify.telegram)
# 4. tolerance: Tolerance radius in meters (default: 500)
# 5. activation_mode: manual|connection|position|combined
# 6. tag_model: samsung_smarttag2 (or other supported models)
# 7. webhook_token: Custom webhook token for testing (e.g., testToken123)
# 8. debug_mode: true|false (enable verbose logging)
